{"id":"149d8f8601e14640","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-continuous-group.md","title":"Continuous Group","display":"df-continuous-group — Continuous Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-continuous-group","aliases":["58-df-continuous-group"],"display":"df-continuous-group — Continuous Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-group]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[58-df-cartesian]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-continuous-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-continuous-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuous-group — Continuous Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"58-df-cartesian\">58-df-cartesian</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\tau,m,i\\in V\">\\(G,\\tau,m,i\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (群谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (拓扑连续映射谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopGroup}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{TopGroup}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (本文件定义的拓扑群谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopGroup}_S(G,\\tau,m,i)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(G,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,m)\\land i\\in G^G\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Biggl(\\forall x\\in G\\;\\Bigl(m(\\langle e,x\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,i(x)\\rangle)=e\\land m(\\langle i(x),x\\rangle)=e\\Bigr)\\land\\exists\\tau_\\times\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\tau_\\times=\\Bigl\\{W\\subseteq G\\times G:\\forall\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(m,G\\times G,\\tau_\\times,G,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(i,G,\\tau,G,\\tau)\\Biggr)\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopGroup}_S(G,\\tau,m,i)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(G,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,m)\\land i\\in G^G\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Biggl(\\forall x\\in G\\;\\Bigl(m(\\langle e,x\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,i(x)\\rangle)=e\\land m(\\langle i(x),x\\rangle)=e\\Bigr)\\land\\exists\\tau_\\times\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\tau_\\times=\\Bigl\\{W\\subseteq G\\times G:\\forall\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(m,G\\times G,\\tau_\\times,G,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(i,G,\\tau,G,\\tau)\\Biggr)\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>乘法的定义域使用显式乘积拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\times\">\\(\\tau_\\times\\)</span>；逆映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 也被约束为群运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的真实逆元选择，而不是任意连续自映射。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cartesian","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cartesian]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (群谓词, see [[58-df-group]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (拓扑连续映射谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\tau,m,i\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopGroup}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopGroup}_S(G,\\tau,m,i)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(G,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,m)\\land i\\in G^G\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\Biggl(\\forall x\\in G\\;\\Bigl(m(\\langle e,x\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=x\\land m(\\langle x,i(x)\\rangle)=e\\land m(\\langle i(x),x\\rangle)=e\\Bigr)\\land\\exists\\tau_\\times\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\tau_\\times=\\Bigl\\{W\\subseteq G\\times G:\\forall\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(m,G\\times G,\\tau_\\times,G,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(i,G,\\tau,G,\\tau)\\Biggr)\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_\\times","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":1605,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad5